---
permalink: explore/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover">
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#34463e">
    <title>Jane's Year Exhibit — {{ site.title }}</title>
    <meta name="description" content="Jane's Year Exhibit: paintings, sculpture, and memories you can step into.">
    {% if isStaging %}<meta name="robots" content="noindex, nofollow">{% endif %}
    <link rel="canonical" href="{{ site.canonicalOrigin }}/explore/">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="{{ '/assets/explore.css' | url }}?v={{ exploreStyleVersion }}">
  </head>
  <body>
    <main class="experience" id="experience" data-base-path="{{ '/' | url }}" data-room-version="{{ galleryRoomVersion }}" data-music-url="{{ '/assets/explore/resolutions-scott-buckley.mp3' | url }}?v={{ exploreMusicVersion }}">
      <div class="scene" id="scene" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <p class="sr-only">Static museum painting: A Fighter in Me. Jane holds her ground amid dark blue and luminous gold brushstrokes.</p>
      <p class="sr-only">Static museum painting: Emotionally Mature Engagement. Jane calmly guides a video call so her parents, Anna and Igor, can focus on Zephrine.</p>
      <p class="sr-only">Museum sculpture: Cat Whisperer. A seated stone Jane with four cats: one on her shoulder, one on her lap, and two beside her stool.</p>
      <p class="sr-only">Warm lighting throughout the museum includes glowing leaf chandeliers, alabaster globes, glass pendants, hanging Edison bulbs and crystal chandeliers.</p>
      <div class="vignette" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="topbar">
        <a class="site-link" href="{{ '/' | url }}" aria-label="Return to 13 Times 3">13 Times 3</a>
        <div class="topbar-right">
          <span class="section-status" id="section-status" aria-live="polite">Gallery 1 / {{ gallery.exhibit.sections.length }}</span>
          <button class="music-button" id="music-button" type="button" aria-label="Turn sound on" aria-pressed="false">Sound off</button>
          <button class="icon-button" id="help-button" type="button" aria-label="Show instructions">?</button>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="room-title" id="room-title" hidden></div>

      <div class="scene-audio" id="scene-music" aria-hidden="true" inert data-track-url="https://api.soundcloud.com/tracks/231167340" hidden>
        <div class="scene-music-player"></div>
        <p class="scene-music-status"></p>
      </div>

      <div class="reticle" aria-hidden="true"></div>
      <div class="look-hint" id="look-hint" aria-hidden="true" hidden></div>
      <div class="joystick" id="joystick" aria-label="Move through the gallery">
        <div class="joystick-ring"><div class="joystick-knob" id="joystick-knob"></div></div>
        <span>Move</span>
      </div>
      <div class="overlay" id="welcome" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="welcome-title" hidden>
        <div class="welcome-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">Visiting the exhibit</p>
          <h1 id="welcome-title">Jane's Year Exhibit</h1>
          <p>Explore three museum galleries: Growing Together, Holding Each Other, and Out in the World. Twelve paintings open into memories. One blank canvas is reserved for La Jolla.</p>
          <p>Walk through a finished painting to explore its frozen scene, then turn around and walk through the gold-edged doorway to return to the gallery.</p>
          <p class="control-note"><strong>On your phone:</strong> move with the joystick. Drag anywhere else on the scene and hold left or right to keep turning; lift to stop. Drag up or down to look. <strong>On a computer:</strong> use W A S D or arrow keys and drag to look.</p>
          <p class="music-note">Sound begins with your first movement or touch. Approach a flame to hear its gentle crackle. Use Sound to turn all audio off or on.</p>
          <button class="primary-button" id="begin-button" type="button">Return to exhibit <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></button>
          <a class="back-link" href="{{ '/' | url }}">Back to the site</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="fallback" id="fallback" hidden>
        <div class="fallback-card">
          <p class="eyebrow">The gallery</p>
          <h1>The gallery is waiting.</h1>
          <p>This browser could not open the 3D exhibit. Twelve memory paintings and two museum artworks are available below. The La Jolla memory is planned.</p>
          <figure class="fallback-static-art"><img class="fallback-preview" src="{{ '/assets/explore/museum/a-fighter-in-me.webp' | url }}?v={{ galleryRoomVersion }}" alt="Jane with a hand over her heart amid dark blue, teal, orange and gold brushstrokes."><figcaption>A Fighter in Me</figcaption></figure>
          <figure class="fallback-static-art"><img class="fallback-preview" src="{{ '/assets/explore/museum/emotionally-mature-engagement.webp' | url }}?v={{ galleryRoomVersion }}" alt="Jane calmly directs a video call toward curly-haired Zephrine while Anna and Igor look at their granddaughter from the tablet screen."><figcaption>Emotionally Mature Engagement</figcaption></figure>
          <div class="fallback-previews">
            {% for frame in gallery.frames %}{% if frame.room.modelUrl %}
              <figure><img class="fallback-preview" src="{{ frame.room.previewImage | url }}?v={{ galleryRoomVersion }}" alt="{{ frame.room.caption }}"><figcaption>{{ frame.room.caption }}</figcaption></figure>
            {% endif %}{% endfor %}
          </div>
          <ol class="frame-list">{% for section in gallery.exhibit.sections %}{% for id in section.frames %}{% for frame in gallery.frames %}{% if frame.id == id %}<li>{% if frame.room.modelUrl %}{{ frame.room.caption }}{% else %}{{ frame.planned.title }} — planned{% endif %}</li>{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}{% endfor %}</ol>
          <button class="retry-button" type="button" onclick="window.location.reload()">Try again</button>
          <a class="primary-button" href="{{ '/' | url }}">Return to 13 Times 3</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <span class="sr-only" id="announcement" aria-live="polite"></span>
    </main>
    <script type="application/json" id="gallery-data">{{ gallery | serializeJson | safe }}</script>
    <script type="module" src="{{ '/assets/explore/app.js' | url }}?v={{ exploreScriptVersion }}"></script>
  </body>
</html>
